# Busy play: a staircase of turns every 0.6 s for ~2 minutes fills the player's trail with short
# segments near the camera, like real play (the bot chases meanwhile). The debug readout shows
# polygons, cpu, fps and late frames as it fills.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
wait 1.4
